{"id":"n62364-1-10","stage":2,"title":"닫히다 · 被关","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62364-1-10-1","ko":"왜 이렇게 덥지?","zh":"怎么这么热啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덥지?","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/556a8e13919bb96daae3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62364-1-10-2","ko":"창문이 닫혀 있었네. 창문 좀 열어 놓을게.","zh":"窗户是关着的呢。我这就把窗户打开。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"창문이","meaning":"窗，窗户","explanation":"창문：窗，窗户；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"창문","audio":"/audio/13938495269cab67783e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71809","senseId":"1","lemma":"창문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"닫혀","meaning":"被关","explanation":"닫히다：被关；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"닫히다","audio":"/audio/c0b82306a040150148cb.mp3"}],"sources":[