:"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"a835c2d2f8006f03","term":"열다","zh":"开","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3","entryId":"66574","definition":"打通或掀开关着或闭着的东西。","pronunciation":["열ː다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe979b7fd696d16a3ad0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.395,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62364","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.2217,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["窗户是关着的呢。我这就把窗户打开。","怎么这么热啊？","汽车真是件很复杂的东西啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么这么热啊？","汽车真是件很复杂的东西啊。","窗户是关着的呢。我这就把窗户打开。"],"answer":2}]}
